<title>USA: Suburban Propane shelf registration cleared.</title>
<headline>Suburban Propane shelf registration cleared.</headline>
<dateline>WHIPPANY, N.J. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suburban Propane Partners LP said on Tuesday that the Securities and Exchange Commission approved the company's shelf registration statement relating to 3.0 million common units.</p>
<p>The common units which represent limited partnership units may be issued by Suburban in connection with its acquisition of other businesses, properties or securities in business combination transactions, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
